---
// AI Section — static, no API dependencies
---

<section id="ai-section" class="relative overflow-hidden py-24">

  <!-- Background layers -->
  <div class="ai-bg-base"></div>
  <div class="ai-bg-glow"></div>

  <div class="relative z-10 max-w-6xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8">

    <!-- Header -->
    <div class="text-center mb-14">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 mb-5">
        <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#399ABE" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
          <path d="M12 2l1.5 4.5L18 8l-4.5 1.5L12 14l-1.5-4.5L6 8l4.5-1.5z"/>
          <path d="M19 15l.8 2.2 2.2.8-2.2.8-.8 2.2-.8-2.2-2.2-.8 2.2-.8z"/>
        </svg>
        <span style="font-size:0.7rem; font-weight:700; letter-spacing:0.15em; text-transform:uppercase; color:#399ABE;">Inteligencia Artificial</span>
      </div>
      <h2 style="font-size:clamp(2rem,4vw,2.75rem); font-weight:800; color:#fff; line-height:1.1; letter-spacing:-0.02em; margin:0 0 1rem;">
        Tu academia con superpoderes
      </h2>
      <p style="font-size:1.1rem; color:#8899aa; max-width:560px; margin:0 auto; line-height:1.6;">
        La única plataforma para academias con Inteligencia Artificial integrada
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Bento Row 1: 60% + 40% -->
    <div class="ai-row-1">

      <!-- Card 1: AKDI (large, dominant) -->
      <div class="ai-card ai-card-large ai-card-akdi">
        <span class="ai-watermark">3s</span>
        <div class="ai-icon-wrap">
          <!-- Chat bubble with sparkle inside -->
          <svg width="48" height="48" viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none" stroke="#399ABE" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <path d="M7 7h34a2.5 2.5 0 0 1 2.5 2.5v19A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 41 31H21.5L13 39.5V9.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 1 15.5 7z"/>
            <path d="M23 19l1.6 3.8 3.8 1.6-3.8 1.6L23 30l-1.6-3.8-3.8-1.6 3.8-1.6z"/>
            <path d="M32 15l.9 2 2 .9-2 .9-.9 2-.9-2-2-.9 2-.9z"/>
            <circle cx="36" cy="24" r="1.2" fill="#399ABE" stroke="none"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div class="ai-card-tag">AKDI</div>
        <p class="ai-card-sub">Tu asistente con inteligencia artificial</p>
        <p class="ai-card-desc">
          Pregúntale cualquier cosa sobre tu academia. ¿Cuántos alumnos tengo? ¿Quién no ha pagado? AKDI responde al instante con datos reales. Como tener un gerente que nunca duerme.
        </p>
        <div class="ai-big-stat">
          <span class="ai-big-num">3s</span>
          <span class="ai-big-label">tiempo de respuesta</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 2: Escaneo IA -->
      <div class="ai-card ai-card-small ai-card-escaneo">
        <div class="ai-icon-wrap">
          <!-- Document with scan beam and corner brackets -->
          <svg width="48" height="48" viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none" stroke="#399ABE" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <rect x="11" y="5" width="26" height="34" rx="3"/>
            <line x1="17" y1="14" x2="31" y2="14"/>
            <line x1="17" y1="20" x2="31" y2="20"/>
            <line x1="17" y1="26" x2="24" y2="26"/>
            <line x1="5" y1="31" x2="43" y2="31" stroke-width="2"/>
            <path d="M5 27v-5h5" stroke-width="1.5"/>
            <path d="M43 27v-5h-5" stroke-width="1.5"/>
            <path d="M5 35v5h5" stroke-width="1.5"/>
            <path d="M43 35v5h-5" stroke-width="1.5"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div class="ai-card-tag">Escaneo Inteligente</div>
        <p class="ai-card-desc">
          Fotografía cualquier factura. La IA extrae monto, proveedor y categoría. Tu gasto queda registrado en segundos.
        </p>
        <div class="ai-big-stat">
          <span class="ai-big-num">0</span>
          <span class="ai-big-label">entrada manual</span>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Bento Row 2: 33% + 33% + 33% -->
    <div class="ai-row-2">

      <!-- Card 3: Salud Financiera -->
      <div class="ai-card ai-card-salud">
        <div class="ai-icon-wrap">
          <!-- Heart with ECG pulse line -->
          <svg width="48" height="48" viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none" stroke="#399ABE" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <path d="M24 41S6 29 6 17a10 10 0 0 1 18-6 10 10 0 0 1 18 6c0 12-18 24-18 24z"/>
            <polyline points="13,24 16,24 19,17 22,32 25,21 27,24 35,24"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div class="ai-card-tag">Salud Financiera</div>
        <p class="ai-card-desc">
          ¿Tu academia gana o pierde? La IA analiza ingresos, gastos y cobros pendientes. Te dice qué hacer para mejorar.
        </p>
        <div class="ai-big-stat">
          <span class="ai-big-num">24/7</span>
          <span class="ai-big-label">asesor financiero</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 4: Evaluaciones Digitales -->
      <div class="ai-card ai-card-evaluaciones">
        <div class="ai-icon-wrap">
          <!-- Document with folded corner and checkmark badge -->
          <svg width="48" height="48" viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none" stroke="#399ABE" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <path d="M10 6h20l8 8v30H10z"/>
            <path d="M30 6v8h8"/>
            <line x1="16" y1="22" x2="32" y2="22"/>
            <line x1="16" y1="28" x2="26" y2="28"/>
            <circle cx="30" cy="37" r="8" fill="rgba(57,154,190,0.12)"/>
            <polyline points="25.5,37 28.5,40 34.5,34"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div class="ai-card-tag">Evaluaciones Digitales</div>
        <p class="ai-card-desc">
          Sube tu formato en PDF. La IA lo transforma en digital. El profesor evalúa, firma y se publica en los portales de padres y alumnos.
        </p>
        <div class="ai-big-stat">
          <span class="ai-big-num">1 clic</span>
          <span class="ai-big-label">de PDF a digital</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 5: Centinela -->
      <div class="ai-card ai-card-centinela">
        <div class="ai-icon-wrap">
          <!-- Shield with eye and radar arcs -->
          <svg width="48" height="48" viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none" stroke="#399ABE" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
            <path d="M24 4l17 6.5v13c0 11-8.5 19.5-17 24-8.5-4.5-17-13-17-24v-13z"/>
            <path d="M16 24c0 0 3.5-5.5 8-5.5s8 5.5 8 5.5-3.5 5.5-8 5.5-8-5.5-8-5.5z"/>
            <circle cx="24" cy="24" r="2.5"/>
            <path d="M19 19.5a7 7 0 0 1 10 0" stroke-width="1.25" opacity="0.6"/>
            <path d="M17 17.5a11 11 0 0 1 14 0" stroke-width="1" opacity="0.4"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <div class="ai-card-header-row">
          <span class="ai-card-tag">Centinela</span>
        </div>
        <p class="ai-card-desc">
          Vigila tu academia 24/7. Detecta alumnos en riesgo de deserción por faltas, pagos atrasados o bajo rendimiento. Te sugiere un mensaje de WhatsApp personalizado para retenerlos.
        </p>
        <div class="ai-big-stat">
          <span class="ai-big-num">24/7</span>
          <span class="ai-big-label">monitoreo continuo</span>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- Bottom attribution -->
    <div class="mt-14 text-center">
      <p class="ai-attribution">
        <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#556677" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
          <path d="M12 2l1.4 4.2L18 8l-4.6 1.8L12 14l-1.4-4.2L6 8l4.6-1.8z"/>
          <path d="M19 14l.7 2.3 2.3.7-2.3.7-.7 2.3-.7-2.3-2.3-.7 2.3-.7z"/>
        </svg>
        Potenciado por Anthropic Claude AI
      </p>
    </div>

  </div>


</section>

<style>
  #ai-section {
    position: relative;
  }

  .ai-bg-base {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0f1624 0%, #1a1a2e 100%);
    z-index: 0;
  }

  .ai-bg-glow {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background: radial-gradient(ellipse 70% 55% at 50% 45%, rgba(57, 154, 190, 0.09) 0%, transparent 70%);
    z-index: 1;
  }

  /* ── Grid layout ── */
  .ai-row-1 {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 3fr 2fr;
    gap: 1rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .ai-row-2 {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  /* ── Base card ── */
  .ai-card {
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04);
    backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
    border: 1px solid rgba(57, 154, 190, 0.2);
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 32px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    transition: transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease, border-top-color 0.3s ease, border-right-color 0.3s ease, border-bottom-color 0.3s ease;
  }

  /* ── Hover: lift + border pulse animation ── */
  @keyframes ai-border-pulse {
    0%, 100% {
      border-top-color: rgba(57, 154, 190, 0.4);
      border-right-color: rgba(57, 154, 190, 0.4);
      border-bottom-color: rgba(57, 154, 190, 0.4);
    }
    50% {
      border-top-color: rgba(57, 154, 190, 0.7);
      border-right-color: rgba(57, 154, 190, 0.7);
      border-bottom-color: rgba(57, 154, 190, 0.7);
    }
  }

  .ai-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-4px);
    box-shadow: 0 24px 48px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35), 0 0 32px rgba(57, 154, 190, 0.08);
    animation: ai-border-pulse 1.8s ease-in-out infinite;
  }

  /* ── Icon scale on card hover ── */
  .ai-icon-wrap svg {
    transition: transform 0.3s ease;
  }

  .ai-card:hover .ai-icon-wrap svg {
    transform: scale(1.1);
  }

  /* ── Per-card left border accents ── */
  .ai-card-akdi {
    border-left: 3px solid #399ABE;
    border-top-color: rgba(57, 154, 190, 0.45);
    border-right-color: rgba(26, 111, 142, 0.35);
    border-bottom-color: rgba(26, 111, 142, 0.25);
    box-shadow: 0 0 40px rgba(57, 154, 190, 0.1);
  }

  .ai-card-escaneo {
    border-left: 3px solid #22c55e;
  }

  .ai-card-salud {
    border-left: 3px solid #f59e0b;
  }

  .ai-card-evaluaciones {
    border-left: 3px solid #8b5cf6;
  }

  .ai-card-centinela {
    border-left: 3px solid #6366f1;
    opacity: 0.85;
  }

  /* ── AKDI watermark number ── */
  .ai-watermark {
    position: absolute;
    top: 20px;
    right: 24px;
    font-size: 3rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: #399ABE;
    opacity: 0.15;
    line-height: 1;
    pointer-events: none;
    user-select: none;
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
  }

  /* ── Icon wrapper ── */
  .ai-icon-wrap {
    width: 64px;
    height: 64px;
    background: rgba(57, 154, 190, 0.08);
    border: 1px solid rgba(57, 154, 190, 0.2);
    border-radius: 14px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  /* ── Card text elements ── */
  .ai-card-header-row {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }

  .ai-card-tag {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #fff;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }

  .ai-card-sub {
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #399ABE;
    margin: 0 0 14px;
    letter-spacing: 0.01em;
  }

  .ai-badge-soon {
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #399ABE;
    background: rgba(57, 154, 190, 0.15);
    border: 1px solid rgba(57, 154, 190, 0.3);
    border-radius: 50px;
    padding: 3px 10px;
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .ai-card-desc {
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    color: #aabbcc;
    line-height: 1.75;
    flex: 1;
    margin: 0 0 20px;
  }

  /* ── Big stat display (replaces pill) ── */
  .ai-big-stat {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 2px;
    margin-top: auto;
  }

  .ai-big-num {
    font-size: 1.8rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: #399ABE;
    line-height: 1;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
  }

  .ai-big-label {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: #8899aa;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  /* ── Attribution ── */
  .ai-attribution {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 7px;
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    color: #556677;
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
  }

  /* ── Responsive ── */
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .ai-row-1,
    .ai-row-2 {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .ai-card {
      padding: 24px;
    }

    .ai-watermark {
      font-size: 2.2rem;
    }
  }
</style>
